WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
You have to help me find out
what happened to my husband.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:07.466
Seeking answers is never
a straight line.

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:08.592
♪♪

00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:10.302
Oh, my God.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:11.845
♪♪

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:16.642
Police are closing the case.

00:00:16.642 --> 00:00:20.604
POPPY:
His widow deserves answers.

00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:23.732
You saw the same thing I did.
You just don't wanna face it.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:28.070
Micah, I'm gonna do the podcast,

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.364
force the police to look
deeper into the case.

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:32.407
I won't only find out
what you want me to know.

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:35.410
-Air it all.
-POPPY: This season...

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.622
we will present the information
ignored by the media

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.040
and the police.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.710
We know what our friends
want us know about
their marriages.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.672
POPPY:
Is Micah lying to me?

00:00:46.672 --> 00:00:49.549
♪ I see the darkness ♪

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:52.386
I'm worried about Poppy,
her marriage.

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:53.553
♪ Leading me ♪

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.264
She's coming loose at the seams.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:58.225
Do you trust her?
If you don't work with Poppy,

00:00:58.225 --> 00:01:00.769
she'll work against you.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:03.063
POPPY: She lied,
tried to gaslight me.

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:06.692
How's that make you feel?

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:09.236
Like burning it down.

00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:12.239
You thought
that you could control me.

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:14.032
I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:16.076
POPPY:
You have to be honest with me.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:19.037
Why did you even want me
involved with this case?

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:25.335
♪ And no answer to ♪

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:28.338
My name is Poppy Parnell,

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:32.467
and I will not give up
until I have...

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:33.885
the truth.

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:39.725
♪ I know your secrets ♪

00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:42.227
♪ I know your lies ♪

